# onnxruntime-node's postinstall downloads a ~250 MB CUDA tarball on linux/x64 by
# default (script/install.js). The media preflight runs on the CPU provider only —
# the download is dead weight that failed the Vercel build (2026-09-20) — so it is
# skipped on every install, here and in the worker's Docker build.
onnxruntime-node-install-cuda=skip
